[en.FOCUS_C12_CLAIM_PONYVILLE]
Restore the relationship

[en.FOCUS_C12_CLAIM_PONYVILLE_desc]
The treaty signed with Las Pegasus allowed me to divert my attention northward, toward the arrogant "Duchess" who controls the ancestral lands of the Apple family. I don’t care about her relationships with Maud Pie and Starlight Glimmer; she has no right to rule that land, and I will govern it better than she does.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CLAIM_PONYVILLE]
申索小马谷

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CLAIM_PONYVILLE_desc]
与洛马基签订的条约让我得以抽身，将目光放在采石农场的北方，那个自大的“女公爵”掌握着苹果派家族的故土，我不在乎她是否有着跟石灰派和星光熠熠的情谊，总之，她没有资格统治那片土地，而我将比她治理的更好。

